## 🎯 Overview

The Private Jet Booking Platform revolutionizes private aviation by offering a comprehensive solution for discovering aircraft, booking charter flights, and managing empty leg opportunities. Built with modern technologies, it provides a seamless experience for aviation enthusiasts and charter companies alike.

### Key Highlights
- 🛩️ Browse extensive aircraft fleet database (Light, Midsize, Super Midsize, Heavy, Ultra Long Range)
- 📅 Book charter flights with flexible scheduling
- 💰 Discover empty leg flights for cost-effective travel
- 🔔 Smart flight alert system
- 👥 Partner network management
- 🔐 Secure authentication & authorization
- 📊 Real-time data synchronization with Aviapages API

---

