## 🔌 API Documentation

### Base URL
```
http://localhost:5000/api
```

### Aircraft Endpoints

#### Get Aircraft by Class
```http
GET /api/aircraft/class/{className}?page=1&limit=10
```
**Parameters:**
- `className`: light, midsize, supermidsize, heavy, ultralong
- `page`: Page number (default: 1)
- `limit`: Results per page (default: 10)

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "count": 10,
  "total": 45,
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10,
    "totalPages": 5,
    "hasNextPage": true,
    "hasPrevPage": false
  },
  "data": [...]
}
```

#### Get Aircraft by ID
```http
GET /api/aircraft/{aircraftId}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "aircraftId": "ABC123",
    "manufacturer": "Gulfstream",
    "model": "G650",
    "year": 2020,
    "price": 75000,
    "range": 13000,
    "capacity": 8,
    "specifications": {...}
  }
}
```

### Booking Endpoints

#### Create Booking
```http
POST /api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aircraftId": "ABC123",
  "departureDate": "2024-03-15",
  "departureCity": "New York",
  "arrivalCity": "Los Angeles",
  "passengers": 6,
  "specialRequests": "Vegetarian meals"
}
```

#### Get User Bookings
```http
GET /api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {token}
```

#### Cancel Booking
```http
DELETE /api/bookings/{bookingId}
Authorization: Bearer {token}
```

### Empty Leg Endpoints

#### Search Empty Legs
```http
GET /api/empty-legs/search?departure=JFK&arrival=LAX&date=2024-03-15
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "count": 5,
  "data": [
    {
      "legId": "LEG001",
      "departure": "JFK",
      "arrival": "LAX",
      "departureDate": "2024-03-15",
      "originalPrice": 150000,
      "discountedPrice": 75000,
      "savings": "50%",
      "aircraft": {...}
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Book Empty Leg
```http
POST /api/empty-legs/{legId}/book
Authorization: Bearer {token}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengers": 4,
  "specialRequests": "..."
}
```

### Flight Alert Endpoints

#### Create Flight Alert
```http
POST /api/empty-legs/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {token}

{
  "departure": "JFK",
  "arrival": "LAX",
  "dateFrom": "2024-03-15",
  "dateTo": "2024-04-15",
  "email": "user@example.com"
}
```

#### Get User Alerts
```http
GET /api/empty-legs/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {token}
```

#### Delete Alert
```http
DELETE /api/empty-legs/alerts/{alertId}
Authorization: Bearer {token}
```

### Authentication Endpoints

#### Register User
```http
POST /api/auth/register

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}
```

#### Login
```http
POST /api/auth/login

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
  "user": {
    "id": "user123",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john@example.com"
  }
}
```

