## 🔐 Authentication & Security

### JWT Implementation
- Tokens expire in 7 days (configurable)
- Refresh token mechanism included
- Secure HTTP-only cookies support

### Password Security
```javascript
// Requirements:
✓ Minimum 6 characters
✓ At least 1 uppercase letter
✓ At least 1 number
✓ Bcrypt hashing (10 rounds)
```

### API Security
```javascript
✓ CORS protection
✓ Rate limiting (Aviapages throttler)
✓ Input validation & sanitization
✓ SQL injection prevention
✓ XSS protection
✓ HTTPS enforcement (production)
```

---

## 📊 Database Schema

### Aircraft Collection
```javascript
{
  aircraftId: String,
  manufacturer: String,
  model: String,
  year: Number,
  price: Number,
  range: Number,
  capacity: Number,
  aircraftType: {
    class: {
      name: String  // Light, Midsize, etc.
    }
  },
  specifications: {
    engineType: String,
    cruiseSpeed: Number,
    maxAltitude: Number
  },
  availability: {
    available: Boolean,
    bookingStart: Date,
    bookingEnd: Date
  },
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

### Booking Collection
```javascript
{
  bookingId: String,
  userId: ObjectId,
  aircraftId: String,
  departureDate: Date,
  departureCity: String,
  arrivalCity: String,
  passengers: Number,
  totalCost: Number,
  status: String,  // pending, confirmed, completed, cancelled
  specialRequests: String,
  paymentInfo: {},
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

### EmptyLeg Collection
```javascript
{
  legId: String,
  aircraftId: String,
  departure: String,
  arrival: String,
  departureDate: Date,
  arrivalDate: Date,
  originalPrice: Number,
  discountedPrice: Number,
  availableSeats: Number,
  status: String,
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

