## 🛠️ Configuration

### Environment Variables (Backend)

```bash
# Database
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/privatejet

# Authentication
JWT_SECRET=your_super_secret_key_here
JWT_EXPIRE=7d

# External APIs
AVIAPAGES_API_KEY=your_aviapages_key
AVIAPAGES_BASE_URL=https://dir.aviapages.com/api

# Payment Processing
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
STRIPE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_...

# Email Service
SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.xxx...
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@privatejet.com

# Server
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=5000
LOG_LEVEL=info
```

### Environment Variables (Frontend)

```bash
# API Configuration
REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
REACT_APP_ENV=development

# Google Maps
REACT_APP_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_key_here

# Analytics (Optional)
REACT_APP_ANALYTICS_ID=google_analytics_id
```

